1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,500
Little Moments.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,479
A Haircut, Just a Little.

3
00:00:03,479 --> 00:00:06,208
Mom takes me to the hair salon after school.

4
00:00:06,208 --> 00:00:10,021
I sit in a big chair while the stylist puts a cape around my shoulders.

5
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:13,740
In the mirror, I look like a person wearing a very fancy tablecloth.

6
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,616
What would you like today?

7
00:00:15,844 --> 00:00:17,877
Just a little off, please.

8
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,229
Sure.

9
00:00:19,229 --> 00:00:20,844
About this much?

10
00:00:21,124 --> 00:00:23,732
She holds her fingers a short distance apart.

11
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:25,420
Maybe a little less.

12
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:27,159
I'd like to keep it long.

13
00:00:27,436 --> 00:00:28,773
No problem.

14
00:00:28,773 --> 00:00:31,482
I'll trim the ends and keep it below your shoulders.

15
00:00:31,482 --> 00:00:33,159
Does that sound right?

16
00:00:33,436 --> 00:00:35,305
Yes, exactly.

17
00:00:35,305 --> 00:00:38,284
I feel better now that we've agreed on what a little means.

18
00:00:38,284 --> 00:00:42,617
Mom sits nearby, reading a magazine with a very serious cake on the cover.

19
00:00:42,892 --> 00:00:44,207
Comfortable?

20
00:00:44,428 --> 00:00:45,630
Mostly.

21
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:49,422
My nose has decided to itch, and my hands are trapped under this cape.

22
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:51,462
You can move your hand out.

23
00:00:51,462 --> 00:00:53,691
Just tell me before you move your head.

24
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:57,057
I scratch my nose, and the haircut continues.

25
00:00:57,057 --> 00:00:59,630
Small pieces of hair fall to the floor.

26
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:03,817
When the stylist finishes, she gives me a hand mirror so I can see the back.

27
00:01:04,084 --> 00:01:05,586
What do you think?

28
00:01:05,812 --> 00:01:07,056
I like it.

29
00:01:07,056 --> 00:01:10,024
It still feels like my hair, just a little neater.

30
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,677
Ready to go?

31
00:01:11,908 --> 00:01:13,141
Almost.

32
00:01:13,141 --> 00:01:15,402
I turn my head once more in the mirror.

33
00:01:15,402 --> 00:01:17,683
A little was exactly the right amount.

34
00:01:17,683 --> 00:01:21,787
Next time, I'll use my fingers to show it instead of expecting someone to guess.
